diff --git a/docs/data-transfer.md b/docs/data-transfer.md
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..6777ba3
--- /dev/null
+++ b/docs/data-transfer.md
@@ -0,0 +1,9 @@
+# Exporting and importing Fizzy data
+
+Account admins can request an account ZIP from **Account Settings**. Anyone can request a ZIP of the cards they can see from their own profile. Fizzy emails a download link that expires after 24 hours. Treat downloaded archives as private: they include card contents, comments, and original attachments.
+
+Card JSON is in `card-details/`. Attachment references point to the original bytes in `files/`, and include the original filename and content type.
+
+To restore a whole-account export, sign in and visit `/account/imports/new` without an account prefix. Fizzy creates a separate account and emails you when the import succeeds or fails. Card-only exports cannot be imported as accounts.
+
+The importer owns the new account. Other people are preserved as historical profiles so their names and authorship remain visible, but the archive does not grant them sign-in access. Login credentials, account invitation codes, and webhook configurations are not transferred. Previously published boards are not automatically made public again.
